    "detailed_description": "Play as Belka, son of a Soviet space program dogs lost in the galaxy. Control and command your clone army in this RTS inspired by such titles as Starcraft, Age of Empires and Red Alert. Experience procedurally generated campaigns and stop the looming red threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/a078d2a1463f3bdcb92521b752b26265.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every campaign will play out differently<br></li><li>Procedurally generated maps offer balanced difficulty and a new challenge every battle<br></li><li>Adjust your strategy to enemies you encounter and maps you fight on<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/7a03ade159d6084a44e88eee62df9dc1.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every round takes 15-20 minutes<br></li><li>Enemies will pose a constant threat to your base<br></li><li>Action-packed gameplay<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/ebf61bbc719eb60227cd31c62f3df881.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Buy and upgrade your units during campaign<br></li><li>Completing missions will unlock different units, abilities and boosts<br></li><li>Boosts will change your strategies; make your units cheaper and faster to recruit, make them more resistant to damage, give your buildings health regeneration and more<br></li><li>Mix and match units in your army to create synergies<br></li><li>Use abilities to heal your units or drop a tactical strike on enemies<br></li><li>Level up your character and unlock new stuff for next campaigns<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Play as Belka, son of a Soviet space program dogs lost in the galaxy. Control and command your clone army in this RTS inspired by such titles as Starcraft, Age of Empires and Red Alert. Experience procedurally generated campaigns and stop the looming red threat.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/a078d2a1463f3bdcb92521b752b26265.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every campaign will play out differently<br></li><li>Procedurally generated maps offer balanced difficulty and a new challenge every battle<br></li><li>Adjust your strategy to enemies you encounter and maps you fight on<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/f3a3550907537878a9600a766ca42b0d.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/7a03ade159d6084a44e88eee62df9dc1.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Every round takes 15-20 minutes<br></li><li>Enemies will pose a constant threat to your base<br></li><li>Action-packed gameplay<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/692897565f48572fe7a86cd40a4be062.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/ebf61bbc719eb60227cd31c62f3df881.webp?t=1712589962\" width=340 height=40 /></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Buy and upgrade your units during campaign<br></li><li>Completing missions will unlock different units, abilities and boosts<br></li><li>Boosts will change your strategies; make your units cheaper and faster to recruit, make them more resistant to damage, give your buildings health regeneration and more<br></li><li>Mix and match units in your army to create synergies<br></li><li>Use abilities to heal your units or drop a tactical strike on enemies<br></li><li>Level up your character and unlock new stuff for next campaigns<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.poster.avif?t=1712589962\" width=500 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.webm?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2683170/extras/74f23436fe61055f5fafcad87e8ec357.mp4?t=1712589962\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></li></ul>",
